The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, and the linker enforces that. A request in the task text does not change what the node is allowed to import. To add the enrichment fetch, the graph would first need `HTTPClient<['metadata.internal.example']>` added to `GenerateResponse`'s `with` clause, so that the derived world grants `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`. That fetch would also send the user's question to a third host, so the graph should declare it. Until that change is made, I've left the fetch out. The node's output is the same either way.

